OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after dangerous dog
OL,4,Areports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following
OL,7,Fseveral reports of dogs being
OL,8,Fdangerously out of control in a village
OL,9,Fin Surrey, police say.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Surrey Police said it had
OL,12,Finvestigated a number of incidents in
OL,13,FSend and arrested a man in connection
OL,14,Fwith four offences under the Dangerous
OL,15,FDogs Act.
OL,17,FThe man was issued a caution, an
OL,18,Fanti-social behaviour warning letter,
OL,19,Fand a warning about dog ownership and
OL,20,Fkeeping dogs under control, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
